							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: November 24, 2004, 12:51:00 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Also, UoP also just changed Guild Leader and several officers out, or so I was told.  Thrashhash is now leading UOP, Migatol has finally let those reigns go.  Too bad it didnt happen a year ago IMO.  There are some good people in that guild who care a ton about the guild and its progress, but many of them have been forced or shoved to RoS while others have had to sit on the sidelines while the current &quot;Buddy System of Officers&quot; sat around and spun circles for nearly a year now.</td>
